    Name "AI Commander Spawner"
    Description "Reinforcements for an AI Commander. 1: place it near your side, away from the fighting (nothing spawns while players or enemies are within 300 m). 2: pick a Preset in the attributes; Commander on call sends a group whenever the commander asks, Counterattack wave when the home objective is lost, One-shot everything at start. 3: done. Spawn now is in the context menu. With no group list it spawns random groups of the commander's faction. While Game Master is open the spawn area is drawn green and the safe radius light (orange = waiting, red = off)."
